[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://drpnqu3pckbcl"]

; The book on the office desk. Origin sits ON the desk top, so placing it is
; `desk top height` and nothing else.
;
; Two emitters, not one. Motes are the bright specks that rise straight out of
; the gutter between the leaves and die at about head height -- they are what
; you see from the doorway. Embers are slower, wider and dimmer, and they
; drift sideways off the desk; on their own they read as dust, and over the
; motes they stop the effect looking like a vertical pipe of sparks.

